{"title":"CHALK","description":null,"products":[{"product_id":"turning-point-chalk","title":"Turning Point Chalk","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eTurning Point 7500 Professional Billiard Chalk\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience next-level cue control with the \u003cstrong\u003eTurning Point 7500 Professional Billiard Chalk\u003c\/strong\u003e. Engineered with exclusive \u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Particle Fusion Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e, it combines multiple particle sizes to create an ultra-fine 7500-mesh formula that delivers exceptional grip, smooth application, and consistent performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned for players of every skill level, TP 7500 adheres evenly to all cue tips—including playing, break, and jump cues—to help reduce miscues while maximizing spin, accuracy, and confidence on every shot. Its premium formulation provides long-lasting coverage with minimal chalking, while the compact protective case keeps your chalk clean and ready for competition. \u003cspan class=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUltra-fine \u003cstrong\u003e7500-mesh\u003c\/strong\u003e professional formula\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExclusive \u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Particle Fusion Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent grip for enhanced spin and cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHelps reduce miscues and improve shot consistency\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with all cue tip types, including break and jump cues\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmooth, even application with long-lasting adhesion\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium protective case for convenient storage and portability \u003cspan class=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e Competitive players, league players, and professionals seeking reliable chalk performance with outstanding control and consistency.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43442245402672,"sku":null,"price":2300.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul29_2026_08_09_42PM.png?v=1785327043"},{"product_id":"taom-chalk","title":"TAOM Chalk","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltimate Grip. Maximum Control. Minimal Residue.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTAOM V10 Professional Chalk\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a premium billiard chalk handmade in Finland and engineered for players who demand exceptional cue-ball grip without sacrificing a clean playing experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIts latest-generation formula provides \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003estrong friction between the cue tip and cue ball\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, giving players the confidence to apply English, draw, follow, and other demanding shots while maintaining a smooth and controlled feel.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned to work with \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eall cue-tip hardnesses, from soft to hard\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, V10 offers consistent performance across different playing styles and cuesports.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose TAOM V10?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltimate Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides exceptional tip-to-ball friction for confident cue-ball control\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMaximum Spin Potential\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps maintain grip when applying English and demanding spin\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMinimal Residue\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed for a remarkably clean playing experience\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConsistent Contact\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps provide reliable tip-to-ball connection shot after shot\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExcellent Control\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Combines strong grip with a controlled and flexible playing feel\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAll Tip Hardness Compatible\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Suitable for soft, medium, and hard tips\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMulti-Cuesport Performance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Suitable for pool, snooker, and other cuesports\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHandmade in Finland\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Produced using Taom's specialized chalk formulation\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe V10 Advantage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMore grip when you need it.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLess residue where you don't.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTAOM V10 is engineered to give players the friction needed for demanding shots while keeping unwanted chalk transfer to a minimum. This means a cleaner cue ball, cleaner shaft, and cleaner playing surface.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Players who want \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003emaximum cue-tip grip, reliable spin, precise cue-ball control, and a cleaner playing experience\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e without compromising performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTAOM V10 — Ultimate Grip. Clean Performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43487419990064,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/027ebbec-84da-411a-b851-3a8ebf7b935d.png?v=1786686720"},{"product_id":"kamui-roku-premium-chalk","title":"KAMUI ROKU Premium Chalk","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMaximum Grip. Precise Control. Expanded Sweet Spot.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKAMUI ROKU\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a premium Japanese billiard chalk engineered for players who demand exceptional grip, reliable adhesion, and precise cue-ball control. Its ultra-fine particle formulation is designed to maximize friction between the cue tip and cue ball, giving players greater confidence and consistency when applying English and demanding spin.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe name \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e“ROKU,” meaning “six” in Japanese\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, reflects its distinctive hexagonal shape and the hexagonal close-packing concept behind its development. This unique approach brings together performance-focused engineering and distinctive design in a chalk developed for serious players.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose KAMUI ROKU?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHigh Grip Power\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides strong friction between the cue tip and cue ball\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExcellent Adhesion\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Fine particles adhere effectively to the tip for reliable coverage\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltra-Fine Particles\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed to promote strong grip and an expanded effective contact area\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExpanded Sweet Spot\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps maintain control when striking the cue ball with English\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHigh Solidity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Dense construction helps provide consistent application and durability\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGreater Spin Control\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Strong tip-to-ball friction supports demanding English, draw, and follow shots\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eReduced Chalk Transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed to minimize unwanted residue on the cue ball and cloth\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eJapanese Precision\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Developed in Japan with a performance-focused particle structure\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe ROKU Advantage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGrip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e gives you the confidence to attack the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAdhesion\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e helps keep the tip properly covered without excessive application.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSolidity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a dense, consistent chalk designed for easy application and lasting performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTogether, these characteristics create a balanced combination of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003egrip, control, consistency, and durability\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUnique Hexagonal Design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eROKU's distinctive \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003esix-sided shape\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is more than a visual signature. Its name and design are connected to KAMUI's \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ehexagonal close-packing concept\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, reflecting the development philosophy behind its ultra-fine particle structure.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable in \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlue, Forest, Slate, and Sakura\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, ROKU combines distinctive design with high-level performance for players who demand more from their equipment.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlayers looking for a premium billiard chalk that delivers \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eexceptional grip, strong adhesion, increased spin potential, precise cue-ball control, and reduced chalk transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKAMUI ROKU — Maximum Grip. Precise Control.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43487424086064,"sku":null,"price":2100.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/3f1159cb-26fe-4e0c-b7b7-2b9284bd70c8.png?v=1786687298"},{"product_id":"mezz-smart-chalk","title":"MEZZ Smart Chalk","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHigh Grip. Precise Control. Consistent Performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMEZZ Smart Chalk\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a premium performance chalk developed for players who demand reliable tip adhesion, strong cue-ball grip, and consistent control. Its proprietary formulation is designed to increase friction between the cue tip and cue ball, helping players approach demanding shots with greater confidence while reducing the risk of miscues.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSmart Chalk is engineered to provide \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003estrong tip adhesion while minimizing unwanted chalk transfer onto the cue ball\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, creating a cleaner and more consistent playing experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose MEZZ Smart Chalk?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHigh Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides strong friction between the cue tip and cue ball\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExpanded Contact Area\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps maintain grip when striking the cue ball at more extreme contact points\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExcellent Tip Adhesion\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides reliable and consistent chalk coverage\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eReduced Miscues\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Strong adhesion helps maintain contact during demanding shots\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eReduced Cue-Ball Transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Formulated to minimize unwanted chalk marks on the cue ball\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConsistent Performance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed for reliable grip and control from shot to shot\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt-In Metal Plate\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Allows the chalk to attach directly to compatible magnetic chalk holders\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePremium Japanese Engineering\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Developed with Mezz's performance-focused approach\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Smart Chalk Advantage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMore Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e gives you greater confidence when applying English and spin.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStrong Adhesion\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e helps keep the cue tip properly covered throughout play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eReduced Transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e means a cleaner cue ball and playing surface.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith its \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eintegrated metal plate\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, Smart Chalk also adds convenient magnetic storage to its performance-focused design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt for Serious Players\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhether you're playing controlled position shots, powerful draw, or demanding side spin, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMEZZ Smart Chalk\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is designed to provide the grip and consistency needed to confidently control the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlayers looking for premium chalk that combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ehigh grip, reliable tip adhesion, miscue resistance, reduced cue-ball residue, and convenient magnetic compatibility\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMEZZ Smart Chalk — Grip. Control. Confidence.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43487434506288,"sku":null,"price":2100.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/0093d36d-fe8c-4d6f-83d1-583ab1c20437.png?v=1786687670"},{"product_id":"super-hybrid-chalk","title":"SUPER HybRid CHALK","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnhanced Grip. Wider Contact. Cleaner Play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSUPER HybRid CHALK\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is an advanced Japanese billiard chalk developed in collaboration with professional players \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLo Li-Wen\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSatoshi Kawabata\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Evolved from the original HybRid CHALK, its formula was completely reconsidered and refined to deliver enhanced grip, improved miscue resistance, and a more balanced chalking experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe refined formulation provides a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eslightly more moist and comfortable feel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e compared with traditional dry chalk while maintaining controlled application. This balanced character gives players greater confidence when approaching demanding contact points, including shots played close to the edge or lower areas of the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose SUPER HybRid?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnhanced Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides strong tip-to-ball friction for confident cue-ball control\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWider Effective Contact\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps maintain grip when striking closer to the edge of the cue ball\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExcellent Miscue Resistance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed to provide greater confidence on demanding contact points\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBalanced Chalking Feel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Sits between traditional dry chalk and very moist formulas\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSmooth Application\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides a comfortable and controlled feel when applying chalk to the tip\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLow Chalk Transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed to minimize unwanted marks on the cue ball, cloth, and hand\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLonger Lasting\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Developed to wear more slowly than the original HybRid CHALK\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProfessional Development\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Developed together with professional players Lo Li-Wen and Satoshi Kawabata\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMade in Japan\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Premium Japanese billiard chalk\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe SUPER HybRid Advantage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMore Grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e gives you greater confidence when pushing the limits of cue-ball control.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWider Contact\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e helps maintain reliable tip-to-ball friction when playing extreme English or contacting lower and outer areas of the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBalanced Moisture\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a comfortable chalking feel without becoming excessively sticky or dry.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLow Transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e helps keep the cue ball, cloth, and playing hand cleaner during play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable Colors\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlue • Green • Purple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlayers looking for a premium Japanese billiard chalk that combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eenhanced grip, excellent miscue resistance, a balanced chalking feel, low transfer, and long-lasting performance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSUPER HybRid CHALK — Enhanced Grip. Wider Contact. Cleaner Play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43489138671664,"sku":null,"price":1300.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/5f103c2b-557c-4f93-aefe-6b500558b8ad.png?v=1786762507"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/collections\/chalk.oembed","provider":"Elite Cue","version":"1.0","type":"link"}